🎯 Ab Kya Karna Hai (Quick Steps)
Apne project folder me README.md banao → upar wala pura content paste karo

LICENSE file banao → MIT text paste karo

.gitignore file banao → gitignore content paste karo

Phir ye ek single command chalao:

powershell
git init; git add .; git commit -m "Initial commit: AI Energy Optimization Agent"; git branch -M main; git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-energy-optimization-agent.git; git push -u origin main
Done ✅ — GitHub pe pura project live ho jayega with professional README.

💡 Pro Tip
Baad me jab screenshots ready ho jayein, to docs/screenshots/ folder banao aur screenshots daal do — README automatically unko dikhane lagega. Ye interview me bahut impress karta hai.

Bolo — ab kis file ka code chahiye? 🚀

give me gigionre and cmd push
Bhai, ye lo dono cheezein — .gitignore file ka content + ek single command jo pura project GitHub pe push kar dega.

