git init; git add .; git commit -m "Initial commit: AI Energy Optimization Agent"; git branch -M main; git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-energy-optimization-agent.git; git push -u origin main
Done ✅ — GitHub pe pura project live ho jayega with professional README.

