### Frontend (`frontend/.env`)

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_APP_NAME=AI Energy Optimization Agent
```

> ⚠️ **Important:** Never commit your real `.env` file. Use `.env.example` as reference.

