## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### 🔹 Backend
| Technology | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| **Python 3.10+** | Core language |
| **FastAPI** | REST API framework |
| **SQLAlchemy** | ORM for database |
| **SQLite** | Lightweight database |
