📋 PART 4: Step-by-Step (Agar Single Command Fail Ho Jaye)
Agar upar wala single command me koi error aa jaye, to ek-ek karke chalao:

powershell
# Step 1: Project folder me jao
cd C:\path\to\ai-energy-optimization-agent

# Step 2: Git initialize karo
git init

# Step 3: Saari files add karo
git add .

# Step 4: First commit
git commit -m "🚀 Initial commit: AI Energy Optimization Agent"

# Step 5: Main branch set karo
git branch -M main

# Step 6: Remote add karo
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-energy-optimization-agent.git

# Step 7: Push karo
git push -u origin main
🔐 PART 5: Authentication (Push Karte Waqt)
Jab git push chalega, GitHub username + password maangega:

⚠️ Important:
Username: vishakha2121 (ya tumhara GitHub username)

Password: ❌ Normal password NAHI chalega — Personal Access Token (PAT) use karo

PAT Kaise Banao (2 minutes):
GitHub kholo → Profile icon → Settings

Left sidebar me neeche jao → Developer settings

Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic)

Generate new token → Generate new token (classic)

Note: energy-project-push

Expiration: 90 days

Scopes: ✅ repo (full control) tick karo

Generate token click karo

Token copy karo — ek baar hi dikhta hai!

Push karte time password ki jagah ye token paste karo

🆘 PART 6: Common Errors & Fixes
❌ Error 1: remote origin already exists
powershell
git remote remove origin; git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-energy-optimization-agent.git; git push -u origin main
❌ Error 2: failed to push some refs
powershell
git pull origin main --allow-unrelated-histories; git push -u origin main
❌ Error 3: Authentication failed
PAT banao (PART 5 dekho) aur password ki jagah use karo

❌ Error 4: not a git repository
git init bhool gaye ho → STEP 2 chalao

❌ Error 5: src refspec main does not match any
powershell
git add .; git commit -m "fix"; git branch -M main; git push -u origin main
❌ Error 6: nothing to commit, working tree clean
Files add nahi kiye → git add . chalao pehle

❌ Error 7: Large file error
Agar venv/, node_modules/, ya model files add ho gayi hain:

powershell
git rm -r --cached venv node_modules saved_models
git commit -m "Remove large files"
git push -u origin main
🎯 PART 7: Cheat Sheet (Baad Ke Liye)
Jab bhi kuch change karo aur push karna ho, sirf ye 3 commands:

powershell
git add .
git commit -m "your message here"
git push
Ya ek single line me:

powershell
git add .; git commit -m "update"; git push
