□ .gitignore file bana li (upar wala content)
□ .env.example file bana li
□ Real .env file gitignored hai (check: .env file GitHub pe nahi dikhni chahiye)
□ venv/ folder commit nahi hua
□ node_modules/ folder commit nahi hua
□ README.md file daali
□ LICENSE file daali
□ Push command chala di
□ GitHub pe repo kholke verify karo — saari files dikhni chahiye
