| Prophet | 1.98 | 2.76 | 3.9% |
| LSTM (Small) | 1.65 | 2.34 | 3.2% |

| RL Agent | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Episodes Trained | 1000 |
| Avg Reward (last 100) | +45.2 |
| Energy Saved | ~18% |
| Training Time (CPU) | ~4 minutes |

