### 📈 Analytics Dashboard
- Historical trends
- Peak load analysis
- Carbon footprint tracking
- Cost optimization insights

### 🎨 Beautiful UI
- Modern dark theme
- Fully responsive design
- Smooth animations (Framer Motion)
- Interactive charts (Recharts)

